<view class="screen">
  <view class="brand">
    <text>ONEIRO</text>
    <text>DREAM</text>
  </view>

  <text class="eyebrow">Archive The Unconscious</text>
  <text class="title">描述你昨夜的所见</text>
  <view class="copy">
    <text>写下一个画面、一个声音或一种情绪也足够。第一版小程序先用稳定样例跑通梦卡体验。</text>
  </view>

  <textarea
    class="dream-input"
    value="{{dreamText}}"
    maxlength="1200"
    auto-height="{{false}}"
    bindinput="onDreamInput"
    placeholder="例如：我在月光下的图书馆里，捡到一把银色钥匙..."
    placeholder-class="muted"
  />

  <button class="ghost-button" bindtap="useSample">试一个示例梦</button>
  <button class="primary-button" bindtap="generateDreamCard">生成梦卡</button>
</view>
